Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.76,0:00:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, if that's the case, we are talking about MDC, how we can enable how we can solve those problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right, so Jensen give two missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simple mission, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,How hard can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:32.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,How we can optimize power for token?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:40.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right, as we went through this power crisis, this MDC number one, we are simplified and deliver a more efficient power architect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:48.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right, cutting back the cutting out the conversion stages, right, and quickly pushing a more simplified compact power design.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:55.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And also we are preparing the next generation of the system architect to support the next generation GPUs.
