Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:45.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hopefully everyone's seen a variant of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is what's ultimately driving the higher power densities over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:53.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh so, we essentially have two things that are going on.
